Portrayal
---------
Parts of this repository are Portrayal's own output, copied here and changed
there (https://github.com/roc-ops/Portrayal), under the same licence:

  vendor/*.js and vendor/rack/   the kit's viewer and rack modules
  assets/dist/                   compiled drawings and indexes
  assets/exports/                DCIM exports

Each set carries Portrayal's LICENSE and NOTICE beside it (vendor/NOTICE,
assets/dist/NOTICE, assets/exports/NOTICE), and those notices apply to it.
refresh-assets.sh copies them on every refresh.

